      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Fundamental Duties apply strictly to Indian citizens only and are not applicable to foreign nationals.",
        "The 11th duty under Article 51A(k) was inserted by the 86th Constitutional Amendment Act, 2002.",
        "Fundamental Duties are non-justiciable; however, Parliament can enact legal sanctions to enforce specific duties."
